ing context:\nJason Jackson's November 9, 2026 comment: the telephony/CCaaS long pole must not obscure potential earlier value from CSR Chat in the Shield Advisor desktop. Therefore this revision splits the roadmap into a proposed CSR Chat track and the staged Voice/CCaaS transformation track. CSR Chat Q1/Q2 2027 value-drop positions are candidate planning windows only and are not sourced commitments. The original December 2026 prototype, July 2027 MVP, Aug-Nov 2027 monthly intent expansion, Q1 2028 routing/callback and Q2 2028 supervisory/predictive horizons are retained as working assumptions from Pawan's revised deck, not approved commercial dates. Proposed owner review: Jason Jackson (Compass Product); Pawan Araballi (engineering); Chaitali Pandit and Bhoomica Acharya (AtlasIQ and Atlas Services); BSC contact center/CCaaS operational owner TBD. Dependencies: scope, capacity, AtlasIQ service data quality, cross-tenant authorizations, CCaaS handoff, Genesys commercial commitment, recording downstream QM/legal/retention, financial baselines.\n\nCandidate listening-agent proof points: December prototype validates audio ingestion + STT/intent; Q2 build/test confirms live CCaaS stream and (if in scope) post-transfer agent-leg capture. Actual milestones need product-owner and CCaaS engineering approval; no confirmed availability dates."}}